 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【比赛战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-29/match2112998date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">穆帅回归后首场大胜！皇马4-1莱加内斯 82贡萨洛马斯坦托诺破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.64" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260729/zhanbao_image_2112998_1785266447_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.64" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.64" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260729/zhanbao_image_2112998_1785266447_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260729/zhanbao_image_2112998_1785266447_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">皇马在友谊赛中4-1击败莱加内斯，取得热身赛两连胜，巴尔韦德、贡萨洛、马斯坦托诺先后破门。</span></p><p><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">【热点动态】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-28/6a68c5ead6503native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">FIFA官宣成立商业子公司：初始估值200亿美元 少数外部投资可入股</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260226/699ff4701371f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260226/699ff4701371f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260226/699ff4701371f.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">国际足联官宣成立子公司“国际足联前进企业”（FFE），整合国际足联的转播、赞助、票务和特许经营等商业权益与赛事运营。初始股权估值200亿美元，向全球引资，计划于今年晚些时候筹集最高42亿美元，并声称FFE产生的所有净收益将 100% 重新投资回全球足球运动。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-28/6a68caa55dbecnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧足联怒批FIFA圈钱运作：足球不可出售 我们谁都不是足球的主人</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282329267172.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282329267172.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282329267172.jpg"> </div><p>FIFA官宣成立商业子公司，泰晤士报指出，这是国际足联主席因凡蒂诺正计划通过这一计划将世界杯的股份出售给私人投资者，该计划可能为他个人带来数千万英镑的收入。欧足联也在《泰晤士报》中发文回应。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-29/6a68fc868d695native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">天空：若因凡蒂诺执意出售FIFA部分权益，欧洲各国考虑抵制世界杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c25dd57f5a_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c25dd57f5a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c25dd57f5a.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据天空新闻独家披露，如果国际足联主席因凡蒂诺继续推进将国际足联部分权益出售给私人投资者的计划，欧洲各国正考虑抵制世界杯。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-28/6a68cae49d05bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">天空：维尼修斯今夏将留在皇马！皇马无意出售并相信他会同意续约</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282338059528.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282338059528_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282338059528_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据天空体育报道，维尼修斯今夏将继续留在皇马。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-28/6a68c087a199dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺独家：22岁萨维尼奥向曼城递交转会申请，热刺视其引援首选</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282245368580_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282245368580_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282245368580_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据罗马诺独家报道，曼城边锋萨维尼奥已向俱乐部递交转会申请。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-28/6a68ae0315af8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">二进宫！官方：61岁曼奇尼出任意大利队主帅 曾带队夺2020欧洲杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282127377377.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282127377377.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282127377377.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">意足协官方宣布，61岁的曼奇尼出任意大利国家队主帅。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-28/6a68c3d61e333native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马尔蒂尼上任16天即辞职！官方：74岁拉涅利出任意足协技术总监</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282300042471.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282300042471.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260728/202607282300042471.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">意大利足协官方宣布，74岁的拉涅利接替马尔蒂尼，出任意大利足协技术总监。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-28/6a68c4e26e384native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">说到做到！库库社媒晒照：已将德拉富恩特的脸纹在自己左臂后侧</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-28/6a68cf2bf2abbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">将德拉富恩特纹在左臂，西班牙官推：库库雷利亚真是言而有信</a></p><p></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">西班牙国脚左后卫库库雷利亚社媒晒照，他兑现了自己此前的诺言，将国家队主教练德拉富恩特的形象纹在了自己的左臂上。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-29/6a68d9b5d5fa0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：尤文前锋奥蓬达租借加盟里昂，租借费350万欧，无买断条款</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260729/202607290035116572.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class